        .asciz  "Find the mines without opening any of them.\n\nLeft click opens a square; its number says how many mines touch it.\nRight click flags a square you think hides a mine.\nClick an opened number whose mines are all flagged to open the rest around it.\n\nF2 or the face starts a new game."
